Review of PR #3577, item 5. The decision file quotes the maintainer
decision and the coordinator's standing-word decision, says that the ramp
is an entry into uncut stock (a slot at nearly the full tool width where
the ring before does not reach the dead end) and that the ramp angle is
the control, and gives the readings of the band.

Refs #3567

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
